                  {
                    "value": "GROUP DEFINITIONS | Cowork super user: active in at least 75% of weeks and at least 6 sessions/week. Steady: active in at least 75% and under 6 sessions/week. Emerging: active in 25–74%. Occasional: active in under 25%. No observed use: no sessions.",
